LIST
- Order: Yes (indexed)
- Mutable: Yes
- Duplicates: Yes
- Indexing: Yes (e.g., list[0])
- Syntax: [ ]
- Use: Dynamic data (can change anytime)
 
TUPLE
- Order: Yes (indexed)
- Mutable: No
- Duplicates: Yes
- Indexing: Yes (e.g., tuple[0])
- Syntax: ( )
- Use: Fixed data (should not change)
 
SET
- Order: No
- Mutable: Yes
- Duplicates: No
- Indexing: No (no list-style access)
- Syntax: { }
- Use: Unique items, fast operations
 
FROZENSET
- Order: No
- Mutable: No
- Duplicates: No
- Indexing: No
- Syntax: frozenset()
- Use: Fixed unique data (read-only set)
